      "comment": "Iwakura Michihiro: Tengu Sweeper",
      "content": "The secret sword technique of Iwakura Michihiro, said to be fast enough to strike a tengu in flight and usable only with a clear mind. It was first used in the courtyard of an abandoned small shrine, where it destroyed the building and broke his blade. The name sounds like Tengu Victor, the title Teruyo promised if he touched her.",
