      "comment": "Iwakura Michihiro: Teruyo of Mt. Yougou",
      "content": "A black-winged tengu, daughter of the Great Tengu Reizenbou, who gave Michihiro the name Iwakura, \"the seat of rock\", and challenged him each year. She was raised on Mt. Yougou and stayed on Narukami Island after Reizenbou's exile. Her farewell asks him to forget her and keep to the human path.",
