      "comment": "Iwakura Michihiro: The Mikoshi Clan's disgrace",
      "content": "In a battle against a tiger-bodied, serpent-tailed beast, Chiyo was swallowed, tore it open from within, and was left stained with sin. In the end she drew her sword on the Almighty Narukami Ogosho. She fled wounded; the only thing returned to the clan was the guard of her sword.",
